---
// Quiz figure for Post 5: 1,000 shares @ 30,000 VND with 2,000 VND cash + 20% stock dividend adjustment.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq05pie">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="Adjustment sheet for 1,000 shares closing at 30,000 VND with 2,000 VND cash dividend and 20% stock dividend before Ex-Date.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Before vs Ex-Date Adjustment (HOSE 50 đ tick tier)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Trước &amp; Sau điều chỉnh GDKHQ (HOSE bước giá 50 đ)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="46" width="262" height="120" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="74" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Day T−1 Close: 30,000 đ</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa T−1: 30.000 đ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="102">1,000 CP × 30,000 = 30,000,000</text>
    <text x="32" y="128">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Cash div C = 2,000 đ (5% tax)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ tức tiền C = 2.000 đ (thuế 5%)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="152" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Stock div I₂ = 20% (+200 CP)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ tức CP I₂ = 20% (+200 CP)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="302" y="46" width="262" height="120" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="318" y="74" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Ex-Date 09:00 Ref = ?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tham chiếu 09:00 GDKHQ = ?</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="102">P' = (P − C) ÷ (1 + I₂)</text>
    <text x="318" y="128">
      <tspan data-lang-en>200 new shares wait ~1–3 mo</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>200 CP mới chờ về ~1–3 tháng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="152" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Net cash div after 5% PIT = ?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền cổ tức ròng sau 5% = ?</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq05pie { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq05pie svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq05pie text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq05pie .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq05pie .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq05pie .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq05pie .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq05pie .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq05pie .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
